**Calculation**

The total approximate amount spent in that month = 360&ordm;

The amount spent on food and education during a month = 58 + 64 = 122&ordm;

122&ordm; → 15000

360 &ordm; → 15000/122 × 360 = 44250

**The answer is 44250.**

